        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Psyvariar 2: The Will to Fabricate (サイヴァリア2: THE WILL TO FABRICATE?) is a vertically scrolling shoot 'em up developed by SKONEC Entertainment and distributed by Success. It is the sequel to the 2000 title, Psyvariar.\n\nThe game was initially developed for the Sega NAOMI arcade platform, and was released in Japanese arcades in November 2003. A Dreamcast version was released on February 26, 2004, and ports to both the PlayStation 2 and Xbox were released later that year.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Psyvariar 2: The Will to Fabricate (サイヴァリア2: THE WILL TO FABRICATE?) es un shoot 'em up de desplazamiento vertical desarrollado por SKONEC Entertainment y distribuido por Success. Es la secuela del título de 2000, Psyvariar.\n\nEl juego se desarrolló inicialmente para la plataforma arcade Sega NAOMI y se lanzó en los salones recreativos japoneses en noviembre de 2003. Una versión para Dreamcast salió el 26 de febrero de 2004, y las versiones para PlayStation 2 y Xbox se lanzaron más tarde ese mismo año.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2004",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
